# Always Read Repository Docs

Before planning or implementing changes in this repository:

1. Read `AGENTS.md`.
2. Read every Markdown file under `docs/rules/`.
3. Read every Markdown file directly under `docs/`.
4. Read the relevant feature plan under `docs/feature/`.
5. If scope is broad or unclear, read all Markdown files under `docs/feature/`.

Research relevant current documentation and primary sources before implementing. Prefer official framework, platform, API, and security documentation when behavior may have changed.

Keep documentation synchronized with implementation changes in the same task.

Key references:

- @AGENTS.md
- @docs/rules/README.md
- @docs/00-application-architecture.md
- @docs/01-component-architecture-rules.md
- @docs/02-feature-implementation-rules.md
- @docs/03-chat-implementation-summary.md
